{
  "$comment": "Blender-built plants (tools/art/blender/families/plants.py): the G1 houseplants, G2 flowers, G3 shrubs and G4 edibles. Listed in the base manifest's packs. Leaves and stems are on the `foliage` finish, so the nature shader sways and tints them. The outdoor ones have a far version (`far`). Clips: the bonsai's sprig and the clipped shrubs' sprigs shrink away while they are trimmed, a rose and lavender stems while they are cut, a meadow flower and basil while they are picked; the crops grow from seedlings to ripe and lose their crop when harvested (`motions.growth`).",
